@startuml admin-security-monitoring
!include admin-common.puml
title Monitoring sécurité - Consultation des logs

== Monitoring sécurité ==
Admin -> Frontend: Consulter logs sécurité
Frontend -> API: GET /api/admin/security/logs
note right
Query: ?type=failed_login&period=24h
end note
API -> Auth: Vérifier permissions admin
Auth --> API: access granted

API -> AdminCtrl: getSecurityLogs(filters)
AdminCtrl -> SecuritySvc: getSecurityEvents(filters)
SecuritySvc -> DB: SELECT audit_logs WHERE action IN (failed_login, suspicious_activity, blocked_ip)
DB --> SecuritySvc: security events

SecuritySvc -> SecuritySvc: Analyze patterns and threats
SecuritySvc -> Redis: GET security:alerts:*
Redis --> SecuritySvc: active alerts

SecuritySvc --> AdminCtrl: security analysis
AdminCtrl --> API: security data
API --> Frontend: security logs
Frontend --> Admin: Logs sécurité avec alertes

@enduml